  "description": "EF Core reference store for OrionLedger. Implements IApiKeyStore over Entity Framework Core: maps ApiKeyRecord, indexes the token hash as the verification lookup key, persists the mutable lifecycle fields (RevokedAt, LastUsedAt, LastUsedCount, and the rotation timestamps), and applies the last-used increment as an atomic server-side update so concurrent verifications do not lose counts. Provider agnostic; ships FindBySubjectAsync so bulk revoke works out of the box.",
